FYI ... Zelig install is failing on Windows Vista Ultimate using R 2.4.1
patched.  The solution is to disable UAC (User Account Control) in Control
Panel --> User Accounts --> Turn User Account Control Off.  Reboot.  And
then initiate installation.

source("http://gking.harvard.edu/zelig/install.R") will generate the error,
but the log follows below.  {R} itself has the problem with package
installation in the new constrained environment of UAC.


Stephen


